    {
      "name": "Modern Glass HUD",
      "cat": "ui",
      "author": "Echelon",
      "date": "2023-08-27",
      "note": "The HUD most PSOBB players settle on: a translucent glass frame in ten colours, with an optional HD interface font. It sits in the Ephinea wiki's skin repository rather than on a file host, so the link does not rot.",
      "noteKey": "mod.n.glasshud",
      "warn": "Written against the Ephinea client. The two HUD files are stock PSOBB and should carry over, but the optional font is written to an Ephinea-only path — skip that file if the folder is not there.",
