    {
      "name": "Echelon's skins & modifications",
      "cat": "background",
      "author": "Echelon",
      "date": "2016-11-22",
      "note": "The most linked thread in PSOBB skinning, running since 2016. Over 25 separate releases — HD remakes of Forest, Jungle, Seaside and Pioneer 2, PSO2-styled zones and lobbies, custom effects and techniques, weapon and mag skins, and a full menu overhaul. Everything downloads on its own; the MediaFire folder holds the lot.",
      "noteKey": "mod.n.echelon",
      "warn": "Aimed at the Ephinea client. Area, lobby and effect files are ordinary PSOBB textures, but the weapon and mag downloads are marked (Ephinea) because they rely on that client's custom-texture loader.",
      "warnKey": "mod.w.echelon",
      "install": [
        "Unless a release says otherwise, copy its \"data\" folder into the game folder and choose merge and replace.",
        "Lobby skins are the exception — their files go into data\\ephinea\\custom\\lobby.",
        "Back up whatever you are about to overwrite; there is no uninstaller."
      ],
      "installKey": "mod.i.echelon",
      "url": "https://www.pioneer2.net/community/threads/echelons-skins-modifications.4357/",
      "links": [
        {
          "label": "All of it — MediaFire folder",
          "url": "http://www.mediafire.com/folder/l9ea03ibkizor/PSOBB_Skins_&_Mods"
        },
        {
          "label": "Forest HD Upscaled",
          "url": "http://www.mediafire.com/file/zrerc41wxqbsgb3/AREA_-_Forest_HD_Upscaled.rar/file"
        },
